jobs.description:
You will work in a close-knit team of around 10 to 15 colleagues and help ensure that parcels are processed safely and efficiently every day. You will use an electric pallet truck and manually scan products throughout your shift.

Your responsibilities include:

• Sorting parcels;
• Moving goods using an electric pallet truck;
• Manually scanning products;
• Loading and unloading trucks;
• Picking orders;
• Preparing products for shipment;
• Storing returned goods in the correct location within the hub;
• Delivering completed orders to the correct loading dock;
• Keeping the warehouse clean and organized at the end of your shift.

Functie-eisen:
We are looking for someone who works accurately and follows procedures carefully.

Requirements:

• VMBO level of working and thinking ability or equivalent;
• You live within a 20 km radius of the depot;
• You have your own transportation.
Language:

• You speak Dutch and/or English;
• Candidates who only speak English are also welcome to apply.In addition, you are comfortable working independently and able to perform well in a busy environment.

Preferred:

• A valid forklift, reach truck, or clamp truck certificate.
